# ===============================================================================
# 👑 Toron Web Server & Edge Gateway - Master HTTP Test Suite
# Use with VS Code REST Client, Antigravity, JetBrains HTTP Client, or curl.
# ===============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@httpsUrl = https://localhost:8443

###############################################################################
# 1. Native Server & Health Endpoints
###############################################################################

### 1.1 Server Health Check Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Toron Engine Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 2. Internal Management & Telemetry API (/internal/api/)
###############################################################################

### 2.1 Engine Status & Runtime Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/api/status
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 System Resource & Performance Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/api/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Active Routing Rules & Config Dump
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/api/routes
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Upstream Microservices Health & Circuit Breaker States
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/api/upstreams/health
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Dynamic Proxy Connectivity Test
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/api/proxy-test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "http://localhost:9001",
  "method": "GET"
}

### 2.6 Prometheus Metrics Scraping Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics


###############################################################################
# 3. Static Site & Web Control Center UI
###############################################################################

### 3.1 Web Dashboard Control Center Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/dashboard/
Accept: text/html

### 3.2 Dashboard CSS Stylesheet
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/dashboard/style.css

### 3.3 Dashboard Application Logic
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/dashboard/app.js


###############################################################################
# 4. Upstream Load Balancing & Failover
###############################################################################

### 4.1 Round-Robin Cluster (Rotates across Ports 9005, 9006, 9007)
# Execute multiple times to observe target rotation in the response payload
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/info
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Cookie-Based Sticky Session Affinity (Sets TORON_STICKY cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/analytics/report
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 IP Hash Load Balancer (Consistently hashes client IP to same backend)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/sockets
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 5. Token Bucket Rate Limiting (429 Too Many Requests)
###############################################################################

### 5.1 Rate Limited Route (100 req/min limit)
# Sending rapid bursts will yield 429 Too Many Requests with Retry-After header
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
X-Version: v2
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 6. Header-Based & Domain Virtual Host Routing
###############################################################################

### 6.1 Header Routing: Route to v2 Cluster (Ports 9001, 9002, 9003)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
X-Version: v2
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Header Routing: Route to v1 Single Target (Port 9004)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
X-Version: v1
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 Virtual Host Domain Routing (Host: api.toron.local)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Host: api.toron.local
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 7. Next-Gen Streaming Response Compression (Zstd, Brotli, Gzip, Deflate)
###############################################################################

### 7.1 Zstandard Encoded Response (Content-Encoding: zstd)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/large
Accept-Encoding: zstd

### 7.2 Brotli Encoded Response (Content-Encoding: br)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/large
Accept-Encoding: br

### 7.3 Gzip Encoded Response (Content-Encoding: gzip)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/large
Accept-Encoding: gzip

### 7.4 Deflate Encoded Response (Content-Encoding: deflate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/large
Accept-Encoding: deflate

### 7.5 Quality Factor Content Negotiation (q= weight preference)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/large
Accept-Encoding: gzip;q=1.0, br;q=0.5


###############################################################################
# 8. In-Memory HTTP Response Caching (RFC 7234)
###############################################################################

### 8.1 Initial Request (Expect X-Cache: MISS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/cacheable

### 8.2 Cached Request (Expect X-Cache: HIT and Age header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/cacheable

### 8.3 Client Cache Bypass with no-cache directive
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/cluster/cacheable
Cache-Control: no-cache


###############################################################################
# 9. Multi-Scheme Edge Authentication (API Key, JWT, Basic Auth)
###############################################################################

### 9.1 Protected Route with Valid API Key Header
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/auth
X-API-Key: demo-api-key-12345

### 9.2 Protected Route with Missing API Key (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/auth


###############################################################################
# 10. Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) & Preflight Handling
###############################################################################

### 10.1 CORS Preflight OPTIONS Request (Expect 204 No Content & CORS Headers)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/data
Origin: https://app.example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

### 10.2 Cross-Origin GET Request (Expect Access-Control-Allow-Origin & Vary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Origin: https://app.example.com


###############################################################################
# 11. Enterprise Browser Security Headers
###############################################################################

### 11.1 Security Headers Inspection (Expect HSTS, nosniff, DENY, Referrer-Policy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


###############################################################################
# 12. Native gRPC Service & Health Probing
###############################################################################

### 12.1 gRPC Service Route Call
POST {{baseUrl}}/order.OrderService/PlaceOrder
Content-Type: application/grpc
TE: trailers

### 12.2 gRPC Native Health Check Probe (/grpc.health.v1.Health/Check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/grpc.health.v1.Health/Check
Content-Type: application/grpc
TE: trailers


###############################################################################
# 13. Web Application Firewall (WAF) & Protocol Integrity Guard (OWASP Top 10)
###############################################################################

### 13.1 WAF SQL Injection (SQLi) Block (Expect 403 Forbidden with SQLI-001 rule)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health?q=1'+UNION+SELECT+null,username,password+FROM+users--
Accept: application/json

### 13.2 WAF Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Block (Expect 403 Forbidden with XSS-001 rule)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health?q=<script>alert('xss')</script>
Accept: application/json

### 13.3 WAF Path Traversal / LFI Block (Expect 403 Forbidden with TRAVERSAL-001 rule)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health?file=../../../../etc/passwd
Accept: application/json

### 13.4 WAF Command Injection / RCE Block (Expect 403 Forbidden with RCE-001 rule)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health?cmd=ping+127.0.0.1;+/bin/sh
Accept: application/json

### 13.5 Protocol Integrity: Request Smuggling Prevention (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# Reject ambiguous requests containing both Content-Length and Transfer-Encoding
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Length: 10
Transfer-Encoding: chunked

0

### 13.6 Protocol Integrity: Control Character Filter (Expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health?param=val%07ue
Accept: application/json

### 13.7 Route-Level WAF CIDR IP Denylist Block (Expect 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/secure-admin/data
X-Forwarded-For: 10.99.1.50
Accept: application/json

### 13.8 Route-Level WAF CIDR IP Allowlist Pass (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/secure-admin/data
X-Forwarded-For: 10.1.2.3
Accept: application/json

### 13.9 Route-Level WAF Disabled Rule Bypass (Expect 200 OK on /services/legacy-api)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/legacy-api/items?q=UNION+SELECT+1,2,3
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 14. OCI Container Auto-Discovery (Docker & Podman)
###############################################################################

### 14.1 Auto-Discovered Docker Container 1 (Host: container.toron.local)
GET {{baseUrl}}/container-api/health
Host: container.toron.local
Accept: application/json

### 14.2 Auto-Discovered Docker Container 2 (Host: container.toron.local)
GET {{baseUrl}}/container-api/info
Host: container.toron.local
Accept: application/json

### 14.3 Auto-Discovered Docker Container 3 (Host: auto-discovered.local)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auto-discovered/status
Host: auto-discovered.local
Accept: application/json


###############################################################################
# 15. REST-to-gRPC Transcoding & Service Mesh Sidecar
###############################################################################

### 15.1 REST-to-gRPC Transcoded Request (GET /v1/users/123 -> gRPC POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/123
Accept: application/json

### 15.2 Service Mesh Sidecar Ingress Listener (Port 15006)
GET http://localhost:15006/health
Accept: application/json

### 15.3 Service Mesh Sidecar Egress Listener (Port 15001 - 80/20 Canary Split)
GET http://localhost:15001/api/data
Accept: application/json



